<html><head><title>Handlers</title></head><body onload="document.title = &quot;MARKER-TITLE-onload&quot;"><p>Event handlers set the title.</p><img src="data:," onerror="document.title = &quot;MARKER-TITLE-onerror&quot;" alt=""><svg onload="document.title = &quot;MARKER-TITLE-svg&quot;"><rect width="1" height="1"/></svg><details open ontoggle="document.title = &quot;MARKER-TITLE-toggle&quot;"><summary>More</summary>Hidden</details><div style="width:1px;height:1px" onmouseover="document.title = &quot;MARKER-TITLE-hover&quot;">Hover</div></body></html>
